{"articleNo":"83969","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83969&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단 참가자 모집 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.29","hit":"6148","attachments":[{"name":"참가자 모집공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83969&attachNo=71506"},{"name":"참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83969&attachNo=71582"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단 참가자 모집 공고</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><!--StartFragment--> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">새마을세계화재단</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">에서는 대학생 해외봉사단 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">파견을</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">통해 도내 대학생들의</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">글로벌 마인드와 새마을운동 정신을 고취하고 새마을운동의</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 글로벌 브랜드 가치</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">제고를 위해 아래와 같이 2013 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단을 모집하오니</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">많은 참여바랍니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 봉사단 파견 개요</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bde0.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;파견국가 : 필리핀, 베트남, 에티오피아</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bde2.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;파견인원 : </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">총90명(대학생 45, 의료진 36, 새마을지도자 등9)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bde4.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;파견기간 : 2013. 7. 15(월) ~ 7. 27(토) (12박 13일)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 270%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 270%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 선발인원 : 45명 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 지원자격</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bde6.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">글로벌 새마을 청년봉사단원</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 또는 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">경상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">북도내 대학(교) 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bde8.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;봉사정신이 투철하며 심신이 건강한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 300%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bdea.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;해외여행에 결격 사유가 없는 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 270%; TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 270%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 참가비 : 1인 300,000원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 제출서류</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00001620bdec.gif\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">참가신청서 1부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -35.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -3.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -4.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">양&nbsp;&nbsp; 식&nbsp;&nbsp; 은&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 새&nbsp;&nbsp; 마&nbsp; 을&nbsp; 세&nbsp; 계&nbsp; 화&nbsp; 재&nbsp; 단&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;홈&nbsp; 페&nbsp; 이&nbsp; 지&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a href=\"http://www.globalsaemaul.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.saemaeulgf.or.kr</font></u></span></a></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">에서&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다운로드</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </spa